WEBVTT

00:27:28.588 --> 00:27:32.487
Her online learning company didn't look
anything like a success early on.

00:27:32.511 --> 00:27:35.000
Instead, she was constantly
trying out new ideas

00:27:35.024 --> 00:27:36.497
and innovating over time.

00:27:37.388 --> 00:27:38.562
In some ways,

00:27:38.586 --> 00:27:41.689
Lynda was primed for this kind
of scrappy test-and-learn approach.

00:27:41.713 --> 00:27:44.371
LW: I actually had
a pretty troubled childhood.

00:27:44.395 --> 00:27:46.766
I moved in with my dad and my stepmom

00:27:46.790 --> 00:27:49.911
who weren't expecting
to raise me and my siblings.

00:27:49.935 --> 00:27:53.660
And, you know, it was just
this feeling of having to find my way

00:27:53.684 --> 00:27:56.160
because all the adults
in my life were, you know,

00:27:56.184 --> 00:27:57.941
having their own problems.

00:27:57.965 --> 00:28:02.171
And I think what I probably am
is a very resourceful person